This licence covers the game code, tools and documentation written for this
project. It does not cover the pixel art under assets/, which is composed from
Liberated Pixel Cup assets and keeps their own licences (CC-BY-SA 3.0 and
others), listed with every author in docs/CREDITS.md; nor the prologue
paintings and audio, which are placeholders made for this project and are not
offered for reuse; nor the fonts under assets/fonts/ (EB Garamond and Cinzel, SIL Open
Font License 1.1, licence files next to them). Story and characters after Madeline
Miller's novel "Circe";
this is a fan project with no affiliation to the author or publisher.
